exports[`复制详细版：en 和 zh-HK 的代表性快照 > en：anthropic / cursor 1`] = `
"Please help me connect Cursor to Hiyo codex (an API service compatible with the OpenAI and Anthropic formats).
Read this first: https://codex.hiyo.top/docs/cursor.md
Follow the steps in the guide and walk me through the setup one step at a time.

Connection details:
- OpenAI-compatible Base URL (for Cursor, chat apps and similar): https://codex.hiyo.top/v1
- Anthropic-compatible Base URL (no /v1): https://codex.hiyo.top
- Key: use sk-YOUR_API_KEY as a placeholder. I will fill in the real key myself, so do not ask me to send it to you.
- Models this key can call: claude-haiku-5, claude-opus-4-1, claude-opus-5, claude-sonnet-5, claude-sonnet-5-20261001
- Full, up-to-date model list: request GET https://codex.hiyo.top/v1/models with this key. Do not fill in model names from memory.
- Override OpenAI Base URL must include /v1. Custom model names must match the model list exactly, and Auto must be turned off in the chat panel.
- Model names in the guide’s examples (such as gpt-5.6-sol) are only examples. Use a model that is available to this key’s group.

Requirements:
1. Say exactly which file path or setting needs to change.
2. Ask me directly whenever you need to know about my system, tools or anything else.
3. At the end, tell me how to check that it works. If something fails, use https://codex.hiyo.top/docs/errors.md to troubleshoot.
4. If you are a coding assistant running on my computer, you may edit the config files for me, but tell me what you are going to change first."
`;

exports[`复制详细版：en 和 zh-HK 的代表性快照 > en：antigravity / chat 1`] = `
