exports[`复制详细版：en 和 zh-HK 的代表性快照 > en：openai（开了调度） / claude 1`] = `
"Please help me connect Claude Code to Hiyo codex (an API service compatible with the OpenAI and Anthropic formats).
Read this first: https://codex.hiyo.top/docs/claude-code.md
Follow the steps in the guide and walk me through the setup one step at a time.

Connection details:
- Anthropic-compatible Base URL (no /v1; for Claude Code): https://codex.hiyo.top
- OpenAI-compatible Base URL: https://codex.hiyo.top/v1
- Key: use sk-YOUR_API_KEY as a placeholder. I will fill in the real key myself, so do not ask me to send it to you.
- Models this key can call (partial list): gpt-5.3-codex, gpt-5.5, gpt-5.6-luna, gpt-5.6-sol, gpt-5.6-terra
- Full, up-to-date model list: request GET https://codex.hiyo.top/v1/models with this key. Do not fill in model names from memory.
- The key variable is ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN, not ANTHROPIC_API_KEY. Remove any leftover ANTHROPIC_API_KEY on my computer.
- If a request returns 400 saying a field is not accepted, add CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_BETAS=1 to env and restart.

Requirements:
1. Say exactly which file path or setting needs to change.
2. Ask me directly whenever you need to know about my system, tools or anything else.
3. At the end, tell me how to check that it works. If something fails, use https://codex.hiyo.top/docs/errors.md to troubleshoot.
4. If you are a coding assistant running on my computer, you may edit the config files for me, but tell me what you are going to change first."
`;

exports[`复制详细版：en 和 zh-HK 的代表性快照 > en：openai（没开调度） / codex 1`] = `
"Please help me connect Codex to Hiyo codex (an API service compatible with the OpenAI and Anthropic formats).
Read this first: https://codex.hiyo.top/docs/codex.md
Follow the steps in the guide and walk me through the setup one step at a time.

Connection details:
- OpenAI-compatible Base URL: https://codex.hiyo.top/v1
- Key: use sk-YOUR_API_KEY as a placeholder. I will fill in the real key myself, so do not ask me to send it to you.
- Models this key can call (partial list): gpt-5.6-sol, gpt-5.3-codex, gpt-5.5, gpt-5.6-luna, gpt-5.6-terra
- Full, up-to-date model list: request GET https://codex.hiyo.top/v1/models with this key. Do not fill in model names from memory.
- In config.toml, set wire_api to responses and keep model_provider and model at the very top of the file. After editing, fully quit Codex, reopen it and start a new session.

Requirements:
1. Say exactly which file path or setting needs to change.
2. Ask me directly whenever you need to know about my system, tools or anything else.
3. At the end, tell me how to check that it works. If something fails, use https://codex.hiyo.top/docs/errors.md to troubleshoot.
4. If you are a coding assistant running on my computer, you may edit the config files for me, but tell me what you are going to change first."
`;

exports[`复制详细版：en 和 zh-HK 的代表性快照 > zh-HK：anthropic / cursor 1`] = `
"請幫我把 Cursor 接入 Hiyo codex（相容 OpenAI 和 Anthropic 格式的 API 服務）。
請先閱讀：https://codex.hiyo.top/docs/cursor.md
按文件裏的步驟一步步帶我設定。

接入資料：
- OpenAI 相容 Base URL（Cursor、聊天客戶端等用）：https://codex.hiyo.top/v1
- Anthropic 相容 Base URL（不帶 /v1）：https://codex.hiyo.top
- 金鑰：用 sk-你的金鑰 佔位，我會自己填，不要讓我把真實金鑰發給你。
- 這個金鑰可以呼叫的模型：claude-haiku-5、claude-opus-4-1、claude-opus-5、claude-sonnet-5、claude-sonnet-5-20261001
- 完整、最新的模型列表：用這個金鑰請求 GET https://codex.hiyo.top/v1/models 查看，不要憑記憶填寫模型名稱。
- Override OpenAI Base URL 必須帶 /v1；自訂模型名稱要和模型列表一字不差，聊天面板裏要關掉 Auto。
- 文件示例裏的模型名稱（如 gpt-5.6-sol）只是示例，請換成這個金鑰的分組裏有的模型。

要求：
1. 要改的檔案路徑或設定項寫清楚。
2. 需要我的系統、工具等資料時直接問我。
3. 最後告訴我怎麼驗證是否成功；出錯時對照 https://codex.hiyo.top/docs/errors.md 排查。
4. 如果你本身就是運行在我電腦上的編程助手，可以直接幫我修改設定檔，但動手前先告訴我要改哪些內容。"
`;

